{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"04.07","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":55,"reply_count":32,"alternative_count":10,"total_audio_count":97,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"04.07.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"收货地址就填这个。","meaning_my":"ပို့ရမယ့် လိပ်စာကို ဒါပဲ ဖြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"放门口就行。","meaning_my":"တံခါးရှေ့မှာပဲ ထားပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"麻烦放门口。","meaning_my":"တံခါးရှေ့မှာ ထားပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"到了给我打电话。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် ဖုန်းဆက်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"送到了打个电话。","meaning_my":"ပို့ရောက်ရင် ဖုန်းတစ်ချက် ဆက်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"不要打电话，发消息就行。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းမဆက်ပါနဲ့၊ စာပဲ ပို့ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我到了给您发消息。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ ရောက်ရင် စာပို့ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"不用餐具。","meaning_my":"ဇွန်းနဲ့တူ မလိုဘူး။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S005_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不需要筷子和勺子。","meaning_my":"တူနဲ့ ဇွန်း မလိုပါဘူး။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S005_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"备注不要辣。","meaning_my":"မှတ်ချက်မှာ အစပ်မထည့်ဖို့ ရေးပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.07.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.07.01-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我帮您备注不要辣。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ အစပ်မထည့်ဖို့ မှတ်ချ